{"strongs": "H3708", "word": "כַּ֫עַס", "translit": "ka.as", "root": "כעס", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "vexation, anger", "definition": "כַּ֫עַס noun masculine vexation, anger ; — ׳ כ Deut 32:27 + 13 t.; כָּ֑עַס Prov 21:19 ; Eccl 1:18 suffix כַּעְסִי 1Sam 1:16 , כַּעַסְךָ Ps 85:5 , כַּעְסוֺ Prov 12:16 ; 1Kgs 15:30 plural כְּעָסִים 2Kgs 23:26 . — vexation: 1. of men, especially caused by unmerited treatment, 1Sam 1:6 ; 1Sam 1:16 ; Prov 12:16 ; Prov 17:25 ; Prov 21:19 ; Prov 27:3 ; Eccl 7:9 . 2. vexation, anger of Yahweh (caused especially by worship of other gods) 1Kgs 15:30 ; 1Kgs 21:22 ; 2Kgs 23:26 עִמָּנוּ ׳ כ Ps 85:5 anger ( of Yahweh ) with us ; בָּנָיו ׳ כ Deut 32:19 anger against his sons , אוֺיֵב ׳ כ v Deut 32:27 anger against the enemy (both object genitive see Di ; RV provocation of , compare Dr ); קָרְבָּנָם ׳ כ Ezek 20:28 provocation of their offering (so RV but Co strike out, rightly). 3. vexation, grief Ps 6:8 ; Ps 10:14 ; Ps 31:10 ; Eccl 1:18 ; Eccl 2:23 ; Eccl 7:3 ; Eccl 11:10 , also כעס Eccl 5:16 accusative Ew aI.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4139')\">BDB4139</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3708')\">H3708</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4138')\">BDB4138</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4140')\">BDB4140</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כַּ֫עַס</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>vexation, anger</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,27)\">Deut 32:27</ref> + 13 t.; <bdbheb>כָּ֑עַס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,19)\">Prov 21:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:18\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,18)\">Eccl 1:18</ref> suffix <bdbheb>כַּעְסִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd